{% comment %}
  ARTWISTIC: compatibility wrapper — kept so existing call sites
  (snippets/buy-buttons.liquid, sections/artwistic-reels.liquid) don't
  need touching. Delegates to the real, shared heart-toggle implementation
  in snippets/artwistic-card-actions.liquid / assets/artwistic-product-card.js
  (window.awWishlist), so every wishlist button on the site — cards,
  product page, here — shares one working implementation instead of two
  divergent ones.

  Usage:
    {% render 'artwistic-wishlist-button', product: card_product %}
    {% render 'artwistic-wishlist-button', product: product, size: 'large' %}
    {% render 'artwistic-wishlist-button', product: product, size: 'large', style: 'inline' %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- render 'artwistic-card-actions', product: product, heart_only: true, size: size -%}
